WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.833
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:35.375
that efforts made toward yoga

3
00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:36.958
don't go to waste,

4
00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:38.875
and because of these very efforts,

5
00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:40.250
in the next life too,

6
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.625
a yogi is born in such an environment

7
00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:47.250
where they can continue the journey of yoga.

8
00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.208
Now here, Lord Krishna

9
00:00:49.208 --> 00:00:51.333
explains this very journey

10
00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:53.708
and tells its destination.

11
00:00:58.708 --> 00:01:01.000
Lord Krishna in this verse says

12
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.208
that yogis who make effort,

13
00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:05.375
passing through many births,

14
00:01:05.375 --> 00:01:06.541
not only

15
00:01:06.541 --> 00:01:08.458
become free from all their sins,

16
00:01:08.458 --> 00:01:09.833
but also in yoga practice

17
00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:12.958
attain perfection. And ultimately

18
00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:14.291
they attain their destination,

19
00:01:14.291 --> 00:01:18.000
meaning Paramātmā.

20
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.375
If a yogi

21
00:01:19.375 --> 00:01:21.958
is born in a prosperous family,

22
00:01:21.958 --> 00:01:24.833
then here there will be
 all happiness and facilities,

23
00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:27.041
worldly worries won't be there.

24
00:01:27.041 --> 00:01:28.000
This makes

25
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.750
focusing on spirituality easy,

26
00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:31.583
but many times

27
00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:32.458
this very thing

28
00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:35.916
can also become an obstacle
 in the path of spirituality.

29
00:01:35.916 --> 00:01:40.708
Because where there's wealth,
 happiness, facilities, everything,

30
00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:43.500
getting trapped in the web of materialism

31
00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:44.833
is also possible.

32
00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:47.875
On the other hand, the yogi who

33
00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:50.000
is born in a family with spiritual environment,

34
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:50.583
for them

35
00:01:50.583 --> 00:01:53.875
this journey definitely becomes convenient.

36
00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:54.875
From childhood,

37
00:01:54.875 --> 00:01:57.708
the influence of spirituality
 remains on their mind,

38
00:01:57.708 --> 00:01:58.583
and with time

39
00:01:58.583 --> 00:02:01.291
they also get proper guidance.

40
00:02:01.291 --> 00:02:03.875
The main point is this – when a yogi

41
00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:05.000
takes new birth,

42
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.791
there will definitely be interest
 in spirituality in them,

43
00:02:07.791 --> 00:02:10.583
their birth will also be in a suitable family,

44
00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:13.208
but efforts with complete dedication

45
00:02:13.208 --> 00:02:15.000
must be made by them themselves.

46
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.875
And as they keep making efforts,

47
00:02:17.875 --> 00:02:21.083
the journey of next births will
 keep becoming easier.

48
00:02:21.083 --> 00:02:24.291
The main things on which
 Lord Krishna is emphasizing

49
00:02:24.291 --> 00:02:27.000
are that no spiritual effort

50
00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.458
goes to waste.

51
00:02:28.458 --> 00:02:30.083
The merit of all these efforts

52
00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:31.625
accumulated together

53
00:02:31.625 --> 00:02:33.083
can make the spiritual

54
00:02:33.083 --> 00:02:35.875
journey of coming births easy.

55
00:02:35.875 --> 00:02:37.375
Along with this, Lord Krishna

56
00:02:37.375 --> 00:02:39.875
is also reminding Arjuna

57
00:02:39.875 --> 00:02:42.750
that even though this journey
 may continue for many births,

58
00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:46.291
but one who makes 
continuous effort on this path

59
00:02:46.291 --> 00:02:49.083
ultimately attains complete
 spiritual consciousness

60
00:02:49.083 --> 00:02:52.250
and supreme perfection.

61
00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:55.166
We must understand that attaining
 spiritual perfection

62
00:02:55.166 --> 00:02:58.291
is not a journey of one birth,

63
00:02:58.291 --> 00:03:02.208
but penance continuing for many births.

64
00:03:02.208 --> 00:03:04.583
Even if the journey is difficult or progress

65
00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:08.250
seems slow, still efforts must be made.

66
00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:09.000
And yes!

67
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.375
None of these efforts will go to waste.

68
00:03:12.375 --> 00:03:15.291
If with patience, firmness, and surrender,

69
00:03:15.291 --> 00:03:17.125
we keep walking on this path

70
00:03:17.125 --> 00:03:21.000
then ultimately we will attain Paramātmā.

71
00:03:25.958 --> 00:03:30.208
Attaining complete perfection in yoga

72
00:03:30.208 --> 00:03:35.708
and ultimately going to meet Paramātmā,

73
00:03:35.708 --> 00:03:40.833
this takes many births.

74
00:03:40.833 --> 00:03:45.000
This journey is long but

75
00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.000
its destination

76
00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:50.458
is equally rare.

77
00:03:50.458 --> 00:03:53.250
The higher the purpose,

78
00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.833
the more time

79
00:03:55.833 --> 00:03:58.916
and hard work.

80
00:03:58.916 --> 00:04:00.666
This matter is true

81
00:04:00.666 --> 00:04:03.833
in every field of life.

82
00:04:03.833 --> 00:04:08.000
Remember, excellence

83
00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:11.458
or success in any work 
doesn't come immediately –

84
00:04:11.458 --> 00:04:14.375
for this, time must be given,

85
00:04:14.375 --> 00:04:16.500
patience must be kept,

86
00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:19.583
efforts must be made with dedication.

87
00:04:19.583 --> 00:04:24.000
Many times a person becomes discouraged

88
00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:28.375
thinking why success doesn't
 come immediately.

89
00:04:28.375 --> 00:04:30.625
Think –

90
00:04:30.625 --> 00:04:35.166
does any seed become a tree immediately?

91
00:04:35.166 --> 00:04:36.666
No!

92
00:04:36.666 --> 00:04:39.458
That seed takes time,

93
00:04:39.458 --> 00:04:44.000
becomes a plant, and then after a long time

94
00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.666
it becomes such a tree

95
00:04:46.666 --> 00:04:50.458
that no one can shake.

96
00:04:50.458 --> 00:04:53.333
And the reason for this is

97
00:04:53.333 --> 00:04:55.833
its deep roots.

98
00:04:55.833 --> 00:04:58.875
To remain firm, having deep roots

99
00:04:58.875 --> 00:05:00.625
is necessary.

100
00:05:00.625 --> 00:05:04.583
If the roots remained weak, then whether tree

101
00:05:04.583 --> 00:05:10.958
or success, both will waver.

102
00:05:10.958 --> 00:05:12.083
You wouldn't want

103
00:05:12.083 --> 00:05:15.291
such weak success, right?

104
00:05:15.291 --> 00:05:18.958
Therefore, give time,

105
00:05:18.958 --> 00:05:22.416
and maintain faith in your journey.

106
00:05:22.416 --> 00:05:27.333
Keep working hard, keep improving yourself,

107
00:05:27.333 --> 00:05:30.958
and don't be afraid of difficulties.

108
00:05:30.958 --> 00:05:33.000
The person who

109
00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.916
moves forward with patience and dedication

110
00:05:35.916 --> 00:05:41.208
definitely attains success one day.

111
00:05:41.208 --> 00:05:43.041
And yes,

112
00:05:43.041 --> 00:05:45.500
just as any effort made in yoga

113
00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:48.916
doesn't go to waste,

114
00:05:48.916 --> 00:05:51.958
similarly in life

115
00:05:51.958 --> 00:05:56.458
every positive effort made polishes you,

116
00:05:56.458 --> 00:06:00.833
makes you strong, moves you forward.

117
00:06:00.833 --> 00:06:04.125
Just keep walking on the right path –

118
00:06:04.125 --> 00:06:06.291
success may come late,

119
00:06:06.291 --> 00:06:09.416
but will definitely come.

120
00:06:13.708 --> 00:06:17.291
The journey of yoga is long,

121
00:06:17.291 --> 00:06:19.000
it requires patience

122
00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.666
and tireless efforts.

123
00:06:22.666 --> 00:06:24.416
But its

124
00:06:24.416 --> 00:06:29.458
destination is also extremely sweet.

125
00:06:29.458 --> 00:06:33.583
Family relationships are also somewhat like this.

126
00:06:33.583 --> 00:06:37.875
Making them sweet takes time.

127
00:06:37.875 --> 00:06:41.000
The secret of a happy family is not

128
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:45.500
that all members are excellent. Rather,

129
00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:49.583
the secret of a happy family is this –

130
00:06:49.583 --> 00:06:52.583
that every person sees the best

131
00:06:52.583 --> 00:06:56.625
possibilities in each other,

132
00:06:56.625 --> 00:07:00.958
becomes helpful in each other's advancement.

133
00:07:00.958 --> 00:07:02.916
Such a family

134
00:07:02.916 --> 00:07:05.583
where if there's ever a difference,

135
00:07:05.583 --> 00:07:08.958
then family members keep patience,

136
00:07:08.958 --> 00:07:11.000
try to understand

137
00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.500
each other's perspective,

138
00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:16.166
and give priority to love.

139
00:07:16.166 --> 00:07:18.166
Understand it like this –

140
00:07:18.166 --> 00:07:22.291
every member of the family is like a seed –

141
00:07:22.291 --> 00:07:26.833
in which many beautiful possibilities are hidden.

142
00:07:26.833 --> 00:07:32.250
If it's watered with love,
 cooperation, and patience,

143
00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:35.375
then it will become a powerful tree

144
00:07:35.375 --> 00:07:38.166
which will itself flourish

145
00:07:38.166 --> 00:07:40.708
and also give shade to others.

146
00:07:40.708 --> 00:07:43.375
Does any seed grow quickly

147
00:07:43.375 --> 00:07:48.000
by putting pressure? Or by showing impatience?

148
00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.333
No, right?

149
00:07:50.333 --> 00:07:52.000
A person

150
00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:55.666
reaches their best form only

151
00:07:55.666 --> 00:08:02.708
when they're given freedom
 to learn, understand, and polish,

152
00:08:02.708 --> 00:08:05.708
rather than putting pressure on them to change.

153
00:08:05.708 --> 00:08:09.291
Every person wants to become better,

154
00:08:09.291 --> 00:08:14.875
what's needed is only
 cooperation and tolerance.

155
00:08:14.875 --> 00:08:18.958
Love and understanding.

156
00:08:18.958 --> 00:08:20.583
Water family life

157
00:08:20.583 --> 00:08:23.833
with love and understanding –

158
00:08:23.833 --> 00:08:26.541
only then will it become a complete

159
00:08:26.541 --> 00:08:28.833
tree filled with affection.

160
00:08:33.333 --> 00:08:35.833
The professional world is also

161
00:08:35.833 --> 00:08:39.833
like a yogi's journey –

162
00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:42.291
here too, to achieve lasting success,

163
00:08:42.291 --> 00:08:47.000
patience, dedication, and
 commitment are necessary.

164
00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:50.666
You can definitely set big goals,

165
00:08:50.666 --> 00:08:51.500
but don't expect them

166
00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:55.250
to be fulfilled overnight.

167
00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:59.791
Just as progress in yoga happens slowly,

168
00:08:59.791 --> 00:09:04.250
similarly in professional life too, success

169
00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:09.083
comes only with continuous effort and time.

170
00:09:09.083 --> 00:09:11.916
The success that comes in haste

171
00:09:11.916 --> 00:09:16.500
won't last. So don't show impatience.

172
00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:17.958
It is better that way.

173
00:09:17.958 --> 00:09:21.625
Just keep doing your work with dedication.

174
00:09:21.625 --> 00:09:24.500
Sometimes difficulties will come,

175
00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:29.083
sometimes you'll feel that progress is very slow,

176
00:09:29.083 --> 00:09:32.666
but remember – even the smallest

177
00:09:32.666 --> 00:09:37.041
step is taking you forward.

178
00:09:37.041 --> 00:09:40.416
Whatever challenges come before you,

179
00:09:40.416 --> 00:09:44.291
whatever problems you solve,

180
00:09:44.291 --> 00:09:46.916
all together they will make you

181
00:09:46.916 --> 00:09:49.666
more capable,

182
00:09:49.666 --> 00:09:52.708
will become part of your advancement.

183
00:09:52.708 --> 00:09:56.541
The main thing is to maintain firmness,

184
00:09:56.541 --> 00:10:00.625
keep making continuous efforts, and have faith

185
00:10:00.625 --> 00:10:05.833
that success will definitely
 come at the right time.
